## 3-7. 기본 학습 실행

문제 파일:

```python
fish_data = build_fish_data(length, weight)
fish_target = build_targets(35, 14)
```

해설 파일:

```python
fish_data = build_fish_data(length, weight)
fish_target = build_targets(len(bream_length), len(smelt_length))

model, score = train_and_score(fish_data, fish_target)
